{"message":"The percentage is calculated by summing coal freight revenue (2,440 + 3,237 + 4,127 = $9,804 million) over 2014–2016 and dividing by total operating revenue (19,941 + 21,813 + 23,988 = $65,742 million) over the same period, then multiplying by 100.","final":{"answer":"14.9%","value":14.912841106142192,"unit":"percent","description":"Coal freight revenue as a percentage of total operating revenue for 2014-2016 combined.","calculation":"(2440 + 3237 + 4127) / (19941 + 21813 + 23988) * 100","sources":["source:t4c1n0","source:t4c2n0","source:t4c3n0","source:t9c1n0","source:t9c2n0","source:t9c3n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}